# Copy to .env.local to override. Both are optional for local development.

# Where the app sends API requests. The default `/api` is proxied to lexico-api on
# localhost:3000 by the Vite dev and preview servers, with the prefix removed (see
# vite.config.ts). An absolute URL calls that API directly, and then its CORS_ORIGIN
# must allow this app's origin.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# The deck to open before one has been picked on the Decks tab. Leave unset to open
# the oldest deck.
# VITE_DECK_ID=
